    "description": "The Logistics Shipments History API enables users to access historical data related to logistics shipments. This endpoint allows developers to retrieve detailed records of past shipments, which can include information such as tracking details, delivery timelines, and status updates. Typical consumers of this API include logistics managers and supply chain analysts seeking to analyze shipment performance over time. By leveraging this data, organizations can improve operational efficiency and enhance decision-making related to future logistics strategies.",
